<title>FRANCE: G Des Eaux sees higher 1997 net.</title>
<headline>G Des Eaux sees higher 1997 net.</headline>
<text>
<p>PARIS, Oct 14 (Reuter) Jean-Marie Messier, chairman of Generale des Eaux, said on Monday that he expected the company's 1997 profits to be &quot;much higher&quot; than those of 1996.</p>
<p>He added that profits for 1997 should be &quot;without doubt higher than the best profits the company has had in its history&quot;.</p>
<p>He said the company made 3.4 billion francs net profit in 1994.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
